  "description": "The meme employs a propaganda technique by using a powerful visual (the lion) and emotionally charged text to persuade viewers to adopt a specific identity or belief. This technique relies on the audience's existing cultural knowledge of the lion as a symbol of strength and the psychological appeal of rejecting conformity.",
